               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I've implemtned the Math::Overaps",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I twas useful in Led (not sure bing used now but probably).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "And I've currently disabled in Range.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "What I think my earlier analsys MISSED is that OVERLAPS really means the same as Intersects, EXCEPT that the real differnece is discrete vs continuous. ANYHOW - CLEANUP THIS TERMINOLOIGY and usage and either implemnt or dont, and come up with clear names and sematncis defintiions.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
